<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">16052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>In Gaza City, twenty-one members of the Khilla family remain buried beneath the rubble of Jabaliya, twenty-nine months after the strike that killed them.</s> <s>Israel still bars heavy excavators from entering the territory, so surviving relatives break reinforced concrete with hammers and shovels.</s> <s>Six months into the ceasefire, no mechanism exists to recover the thousands of dead still entombed in their own homes.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Israeli strikes hit a residential building in Gaza's Rimal district on Nakba Day, killing three women, a child, and three other Palestinians.</s> <s>The military said it had targeted Hamas commander Izz al-Din al-Haddad; Hamas hasn't confirmed his death.</s> <s>Eight hundred and fifty-seven Palestinians have been killed since the ceasefire began.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's universities have become a recruitment pipeline for the drone war over Ukraine.</s> <s>Two hundred and seventy institutions now offer free tuition and up to seventy thousand dollars to students who serve a year as military drone pilots, marketed as non-combat work.</s> <s>At least one student has already been killed, and Moscow's target is one hundred and sixty-eight thousand operators by year's end.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mexico has quietly formalised what its own security law forbids.</s> <s>After two <sub alias="C I A">CIA</sub> agents died in Chihuahua in April, the state governor signed a live surveillance-sharing arrangement with United States federal agencies, then declined to appear before the Senate to explain it.</s> <s>The two-thousand-twenty security law bars foreign agents from operating on Mexican soil, but enforcement now appears optional.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington is reviving a thirty-year-old grievance against Havana.</s> <s>The Justice Department's moving to indict ninety-four-year-old Raúl Castro over the nineteen ninety-six shootdown of four exile pilots, even as the <sub alias="C I A">CIA</sub> reportedly offered Cuba one hundred million dollars before charges were filed.</s> <s>A grand jury must still approve, and the political utility for Miami voters is doing most of the work here.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Suspected Boko Haram fighters raided a school in Mussa village in Borno State during class hours on Friday, abducting an unknown number of pupils.</s> <s>The deputy speaker confirmed the raid but wouldn't say how many children had been taken.</s> <s>Nigeria's military and police issued no statement by nightfall.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One hundred and three Filipinos have sued Shell at Britain's Royal Courts over deaths from Typhoon Odette.</s> <s>The case uses attribution science to link Shell's emissions to the storm's intensification, claiming compensation under the polluter-pays principle.</s> <s>A win would be the first court ruling tying a specific oil company to a specific climate disaster.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Lahore High Court has voided a one hundred and fifteen million rupee super-tax demand on the sale of inherited land.</s> <s>The ruling held that zero-rate capital gains carry zero super-tax liability, citing an earlier Federal Constitutional Court precedent that limits the levy's reach.</s> <s>It's the second court in months to narrow the revenue board's powers, as Islamabad's <sub alias="I M F">IMF</sub>-driven push to mobilise tax keeps losing in court.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vietnam is staking its next development phase on semiconductor packaging and test capacity, not on building fabs.</s> <s>Back-end assembly requires far less capital than fabrication, giving Hanoi a credible on-ramp into the supply chain as American firms seek to diversify away from China.</s> <s>It's the realistic China-alternative play... not the headline-grabbing one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's food inflation reached sixteen point zero six percent year-on-year in April, above the headline rate of fifteen point six nine percent.</s> <s>Two and a half years after President Tinubu removed the fuel subsidy, core prices have eased but food remains the binding cost for households.</s> <s>The reform's macro promise hasn't reached the kitchen.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Spanish police seized thirty metric tons of cocaine from the vessel Arconian as it departed Sierra Leone, the largest single bust on record.</s> <s>The Colombian-sourced cargo was routed through West Africa to avoid Atlantic interdiction, linking the Dutch-Moroccan Mocro Maffia to a deepening African transshipment corridor.</s> <s>The map of the cocaine trade is moving south.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's monsoon is forecast to arrive over Kerala six days early.</s> <s>The system delivers seventy percent of the country's annual rainfall, and the Meteorological Department projects eighty centimetres this year, eight percent below average, as El Niño emerges in the Pacific.</s> <s>An early onset under a warming Pacific is itself the story... what controls kharif sowing and reservoir refill is now harder to predict.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain has cut its Green Climate Fund pledge from one point six two billion pounds to eight hundred and fifteen million, losing its top-donor position.</s> <s>Germany, France, and Japan now hold larger pledges, and the fund's director warned of a material impact on three hundred and fifty-four active projects.</s> <s>It's a quiet retreat from a commitment London once used to define its climate leadership.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Vera C. Rubin Observatory in Chile has already identified near-Earth asteroids, failed supernovas, and interstellar visitors within weeks of first light.</s> <s>It images the full visible sky every few nights through a single automated pipeline, replacing the targeted searches that defined a century of astronomy.</s> <s>Rubin will run for a decade, and what it finds in year one is already rewriting the catalogue.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A study of three thousand and ninety-nine elderly Americans found that loneliness, the subjective feeling rather than physical isolation, predicted faster motor decline and worse Parkinsonism.</s> <s>Even after controlling for depression and genetic risk, the feeling itself remained the binding factor.</s> <s>The mechanism may run through the same brain circuits that govern movement... how one feels about being alone shapes how the body ages.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A jury in San Francisco begins deliberating Monday over OpenAI's two-thousand-twenty-five restructuring.</s> <s>Elon Musk argues that Sam Altman violated a nonprofit-development pledge when the for-profit arm converted to a public benefit corporation now valued near one trillion dollars.</s> <s>The verdict will set precedent for every nonprofit-to-public-benefit conversion across the artificial intelligence industry.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A federal judge has paused Anthropic's one point five billion dollar copyright settlement with authors.</s> <s>Class members objected that lawyers sought three hundred and twenty million dollars, over ten thousand dollars an hour, while each author stands to receive only three thousand.</s> <s>Twenty-five authors have already opted out and filed a separate suit.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lebanon owns no stake in any submarine cable on its own shores.</s> <s>Foreign operators route all Lebanese internet traffic, and the cabinet's January decision to join the Medusa Mediterranean cable came at access-only terms with no landing point.</s> <s>Israel, Cyprus, Greece, and the Gulf states hold equity in the cables that surround Beirut... the country sits on the seabed of a network it doesn't own.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The preprint server arXiv will now ban authors for a year if they submit work with hallucinated references or unedited language-model prompts.</s> <s>Future submissions from banned authors must pass peer review, the first hard gate on a major preprint server.</s> <s>Fabricated citations have appeared in one in two hundred and seventy-seven biomedical papers in recent audits.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>